---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Disclaimer" description="Disclaimer for Ai Art Spell">
  <section class="info-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="info-meta">Last updated: 2026-07-30</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container info-prose">
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>1. Purpose</h2>
        <p>
          Ai Art Spell is a non-commercial educational reference. We curate prompts for
          AI image-generation models and always credit the original author of each entry.
        </p>

        <h2>2. No affiliation</h2>
        <p>
          We are not affiliated with any AI model provider (Google, OpenAI, Midjourney,
          Stability AI, Black Forest Labs, etc.), or with the authors whose prompts we feature.
          All trademarks belong to their respective owners.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Accuracy</h2>
        <p>
          Prompts are presented as-is from their original source. We do not verify whether a
          prompt actually produces the visual result shown in the source image. Visual results
          depend heavily on the specific model version, fine-tunes, and random seeds used.
          Reproduction may require iteration.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Third-party content</h2>
        <p>
          Source URLs point to third-party platforms (X, Xiaohongshu, Discord, etc.). We are not
          responsible for content, availability, or practices of those platforms. If you are a
          copyright holder and want content removed, see our <a href="/contact">contact</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>
          This site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. Use prompts at your own
          risk; comply with each model's terms of service and content policies.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this disclaimer at any time. Continued use of the site after changes
          constitutes acceptance.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .info-hero { padding: 80px 0 32px; text-align: center; }
  .info-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 4.5vw, 44px);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .info-meta { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 14px; margin: 0; }
  .info-prose { max-width: 760px; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 20px; margin: 28px 0 10px; font-weight: 700; }
  .prose p { color: var(--text-soft); line-height: 1.75; }
  .prose a { color: var(--accent-soft); }
</style>